## Mandatory Workflow

Before any change is considered done, you MUST pass the Final Gate:

```bash
npm run gate
```

## Build & Test

```bash
npm install
npm run build          # Production build
npm run serve          # Serve built site
npm run start          # Development server
```

## Run Locally

```bash
npm start
# Open http://localhost:3000
```

